This product includes modifications of workerd, Cloudflare's JavaScript/Wasm runtime
(https://github.com/cloudflare/workerd), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Coworkerd builds upstream tag v1.20261012.1 (commit 5358e3d337336eaf696a48bc1563d808b10feba5);
the files in patches/workerd/ are modifications of that work, applied in the order of
patches/workerd/series. The workerd binary in the release packages and images is built from
that tag with those patches.

The build fetches Cap'n Proto (https://github.com/capnproto/capnproto, MIT License) and applies
patches/kj-http-abort.diff to it.

examples/email-routing-template/ and examples/x402-proxy-template/ are official Cloudflare
templates (https://github.com/cloudflare/templates), included as they are under the MIT License;
each directory has its LICENSE file.
